Package: omnikit
Type: Package
Title: Multi-Omics Toolkit for Cross-Species, Spatial and Integrative Kidney Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Lingzhang", "Meng", email = "m.lingzhang@hotmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Lingzhang Meng [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Lingzhang Meng <m.lingzhang@hotmail.com>
Description: Dependency-light, algorithm-first implementations of the analysis primitives used
    across a Lupus-nephritis kidney programme: depth-robust gene-programme scoring and
    cross-species conservation, QC and doublet auditing, spatial niche statistics, and cross-omics
    integration. Core estimators (AUC/DeLong, UCell, Moran's I, Geary's C, NMF, CCA, MOFA-style
    factor analysis) are implemented from their definitions; see README.md and docs/MATH.md.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports: stats, Matrix, graphics, grDevices
Suggests: testthat, ggplot2
URL: https://github.com/LingzhangMeng/omnikit
BugReports: https://github.com/LingzhangMeng/omnikit/issues
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
